#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Store Qiskit objects to disk so you can continue where you left off"
msgstr "Ukládej objekty Qiskit na disk nebo do cloudu, abys mohl pokračovat tam, kde jsi skončil"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save circuits to disk"
msgstr "Ukládání a načítání objektů Qiskit"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/save-circuits.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/save-circuits.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/*\n"
"  DO NOT EDIT THIS CELL!!!\n"
"  This cell's content is generated automatically by a script. Anything you add\n"
"  here will be removed next time the notebook is run. To add new content, create\n"
"  a new cell before or after this one.\n"
"*/}\n"
msgstr ""
"{/*\n"
"  DO NOT EDIT THIS CELL!!!\n"
"  This cell's content is generated automatically by a script. Anything you add\n"
"  here will be removed next time the notebook is run. To add new content, create\n"
"  a new cell before or after this one.\n"
"*/}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Verze balíčků\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kód na této stránce byl vyvinut s následujícími požadavky.\n"
"Doporučujeme používat tyto verze nebo novější.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Use [QPY serialization](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qpy) to save your circuit to file. QPY files store the full Qiskit circuit object and will be compatible with newer versions of Qiskit (although not necessarily with older versions of Qiskit).\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Použij [serializaci QPY](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qpy) k uložení svého Circuit do souboru. Soubory QPY uchovávají celý objekt Circuit Qiskitu a budou kompatibilní s novějšími verzemi Qiskitu (ne nutně však se staršími verzemi).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To demonstrate, the following cell creates a simple quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr "Jako ukázku vytvoří následující buňka jednoduchý kvantový Circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To save this file to disk, use the `qpy.dump` function. You can also save a list of circuits.\n"
msgstr "Chceš-li tento soubor uložit na disk, použij funkci `qpy.dump`. Můžeš také uložit seznam Circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This circuit is now saved to the file `test.qpy`. If you restart your Python kernel, you can re-load the circuit using the `qpy.load` function. Note that this always returns a list of circuits, even if you only serialized one circuit.\n"
msgstr "Tento Circuit je nyní uložen v souboru `test.qpy`. Pokud restartuješ svůj Python kernel, můžeš Circuit znovu načíst pomocí funkce `qpy.load`. Všimni si, že tato funkce vždy vrací seznam Circuit, i když jsi serializoval pouze jeden obvod.\n"

